    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/guyyyyyyys.JPG\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 177px;\" /><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">f</mtext><mfenced><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mtext></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>a</mtext><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">f</mtext><msup><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mtext></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />At&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">f&#160;</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">'</mo></msup><mfenced><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mtext></mfenced></math> is not defined.<br /><br />hence sign scheme of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">f&#160;</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">'</mo></msup><mfenced><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mtext></mfenced></math> is</p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/21077.jpg\" style=\"width: 268px; height: 116px;\" /><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is maximum at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br />Hence maximum value of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to &quot;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math>&quot;",
